{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/2d7da9396ff1f7672110580f23a9e8fa.avif?t=1758409380\" width=600 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken without memories, disoriented and alone, until a mysterious voice over a speaker offers you a way out. Hunted by unstable pursuers, your only chance at survival is to follow its cryptic guidance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll piece together fragments of a past scarred by trauma, confront truths better left forgotten, and discover why the path forward leads to one unavoidable destination: your birthday party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/14838a09d08ff12ffac06c6fcab974a3.poster.avif?t=1758409380\" width=600 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/14838a09d08ff12ffac06c6fcab974a3.webm?t=1758409380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bittersweet Birthday</i> is a story-driven action RPG where every battle is a boss fight, each one a unique, challenging test that blends \u201cSouls-like precision\u201d with bullet hell chaos. Survival means mastering enemy patterns, timing your dodges, and striking with precision in battles that demand both patience and nerve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/652c566810c5697f05910f33f6e0df11.poster.avif?t=1758409380\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/652c566810c5697f05910f33f6e0df11.webm?t=1758409380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/652c566810c5697f05910f33f6e0df11.mp4?t=1758409380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/0f5a7bb764cbc9c2edaa21321dce14f3.poster.avif?t=1758409380\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/0f5a7bb764cbc9c2edaa21321dce14f3.apng?t=1758409380\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=112 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside combat, you\u2019ll explore a bustling town, uncover secrets, complete side quests, and collect mementos that shape your fighting style. Packed with an eccentric cast of characters, nostalgic pixel art, quirky mini-games, and even collectible gachapon, <i>Bittersweet Birthday</i> offers a blend of punishing challenge and heartfelt charm unlike anything else. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/1dc063ed3d37f31397d250abb84cf354.poster.avif?t=1758409380\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/1dc063ed3d37f31397d250abb84cf354.webm?t=1758409380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/1dc063ed3d37f31397d250abb84cf354.mp4?t=1758409380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story of mystery driven by endearing characters! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lively village with friendly residents and interlocking quests ready to explore! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punishing combat where reading the enemy is the key to victory! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A darts mini-game! Well, darts are being used, at least... </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Gachapon machine with 48 collectibles up for grabs! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand drawn pixel-art with beautifully designed backgrounds! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully re-mappable input and support for PlayStation, Xbox, and PC controllers! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dog!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1581100?t=1758409380","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758409380","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758409380","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758409380","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1593480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/2d7da9396ff1f7672110580f23a9e8fa.avif?t=1758409380\" width=600 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken without memories, disoriented and alone, until a mysterious voice over a speaker offers you a way out. Hunted by unstable pursuers, your only chance at survival is to follow its cryptic guidance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll piece together fragments of a past scarred by trauma, confront truths better left forgotten, and discover why the path forward leads to one unavoidable destination: your birthday party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/14838a09d08ff12ffac06c6fcab974a3.poster.avif?t=1758409380\" width=600 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/14838a09d08ff12ffac06c6fcab974a3.webm?t=1758409380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bittersweet Birthday</i> is a story-driven action RPG where every battle is a boss fight, each one a unique, challenging test that blends \u201cSouls-like precision\u201d with bullet hell chaos. Survival means mastering enemy patterns, timing your dodges, and striking with precision in battles that demand both patience and nerve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/652c566810c5697f05910f33f6e0df11.poster.avif?t=1758409380\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/652c566810c5697f05910f33f6e0df11.webm?t=1758409380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extras/652c566810c5697f05910f33f6e0df11.mp4?t=1758409380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581100/extra